## Running tests

```bash
# Unit tests
pytest tests/ -v

# With coverage
pytest tests/ --cov=agent --cov-report=term-missing
```

---

## Teardown

```bash
# Remove AgentCore deployments
aws bedrock-agentcore delete-agent --agent-name frugal-architect-agent-prod
aws bedrock-agentcore delete-agent --agent-name frugal-architect-agent-staging
aws bedrock-agentcore delete-agent --agent-name frugal-architect-agent-dev

# Destroy CDK stacks (ECR repository uses RETAIN policy — delete manually to avoid losing images)
cd infra
cdk destroy FrugalArchitectMonitoringStack
# To also destroy the ECR repository (removes all images):
aws ecr delete-repository --repository-name frugal-architect-agent --force
cdk destroy FrugalArchitectEcrStack
```

